\details{
\subsection{Main workflow}{

The typical workflow is:
\enumerate{
\item Load element phases as a table and species annotation package.
\item Construct the phases list for the desired sets or processes.
\item Compute circular statistics and departure from uniformity for
each set.
\item For non-uniform sets, compare against global phase distribution.
\item In the case of multiple conditions, determine differentially timed sets
between conditions.
\item For multimodal sets, analyze the number of modes and cluster its elements.
\item Calculate contribution of each element to its set's statistics.
\item Plot results as circular boxplot, dotplot or histogram.
}
}

